# The local model for PR Verification, with its context size set explicitly.
#
# Ollama's OpenAI-compatible endpoint cannot take a context size on a request, and Ollama's own
# default can be as small as 4096 tokens, beyond which a prompt is cut short without any error.
# The size is therefore fixed here, in the model itself.
#
#   ollama create pr-verification-qwen -f ollama/Modelfile
FROM qwen3.8:27b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
